ture Pass  \n ansen-changan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:01:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:01:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161491841,"discussion_id":"28476aa110f552a50c40012aa3467f120bf2033a","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:01:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:01:49+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161491991,"discussion_id":"fed13b145eda9360b10e97aacc18045d30d2afc8","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了Flash Attention梯度计算后处理模块中的一个算法逻辑缺陷。原代码在处理NZ（非零）输入格式时，对梯度缩放因子`dsink`的累加和计算存在符号处理错误，导致最终写入全局内存的值不正确。该修复确保了在特定配置下，梯度缩放因子的后处理计算结果的准确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改聚焦于`FlashAttentionScoreGradPost`模板类的`NZProcess`方法。核心改动有两处：首先，在循环内部将`dsinkCalc`的赋值操作修正为累加操作（`dsinkCalc += vecOut.GetValue(0)`）；其次，将最终写入全局内存`dsinkGm`的值修正为`-dsinkCalc`。此方案确保了从工作空间读取的多个数据块经过归约求和后，其和能被正确累加，并在最终存储时应用正确的符号。","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:02:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161492223,"discussion_id":"c1d3510912c01719b5a327b9e56faed1fd8dbbe1","body":"### 逻辑运算与副作用: 在设置 copyPadParams.isPad 时，使用条件 `((itemNum % 8) == 0) ? false : true`。这个逻辑可以简化为 `(itemNum % 8) != 0`。虽然当前写法功能正确，但不够简洁。\n\n**问题类型**: 逻辑运算与副作用\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 823\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\ncopyPadParams.isPad = ((itemNum % 8) == 0) ? false : true;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n简化为：`copyPadParams.isPad = (itemNum % 8) != 0;`\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:03:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:10:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":823,"end_new_line":823,"start_old_line":823,"end_old_line":823,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161492238,"discussion_id":"b93db0af730d45390f17f3c52068496d48966f05","body":"### 数组越界与内存安全: 在计算 rightPadding 时，使用 `8 - (itemNum % 8)`。当 itemNum % 8 为 0 时，rightPadding 为 8，但此时 isPad 为 false，所以不会使用这个值。然而，如果 isPad 的逻辑发生变化，这个计算可能导致意外的填充行为。\n\n**问题类型**: 数组越界与内存安全\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 825\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\ncopyPadParams.rightPadding = 8 - (itemNum % 8);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n1. 保持当前逻辑，但添加注释说明当 itemNum % 8 == 0 时，isPad 为 false，所以 rightPadding 不会被使用。\n2. 或者改为：`copyPadParams.rightPadding = (itemNum % 8 == 0) ? 0 : 8 - (itemNum % 8);`\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:03:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:10:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":825,"end_new_line":825,"start_old_line":825,"end_old_line":825,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161492252,"discussion_id":"9848cb07932f3a795c585f5b0649a2aa71b7b8bc","body":"### 数值计算: dsink计算中的dataSizePerN1计算公式可能产生整数除法截断问题。公式为：int dataSizePerN1 = tilingData->postTilingData.b * s1Pad * s2Pad / tilingData->postTilingData.baseMN; 如果分子不能被baseMN整除，会导致精度损失。\n\n**问题类型**: 数值计算\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 804\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nint dataSizePerN1 = tilingData->postTilingData.b * s1Pad * s2Pad / tilingData->postTilingData.baseMN;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n1. 考虑使用浮点数计算或检查整除条件。2. 如果必须使用整数，添加断言确保整除。3. 或者使用向上取整：int dataSizePerN1 = (tilingData->postTilingData.b * s1Pad * s2Pad + tilingData->postTilingData.baseMN - 1) / tilingData->postTilingData.baseMN;\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:03:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:10:47+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":804,"end_new_line":804,"start_old_line":804,"end_old_line":804,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161492262,"discussion_id":"f7824cf26f233e4af24cb32e31b167cc14f6ef5c","body":"### 边界条件: 在dsink计算循环中，当tailDsinkSumSize为0时，currentCopyDataSize的计算可能导致逻辑错误。如果dataSizePerN1 * sizeof(float)正好是2 * ubBaseSize的倍数，tailDsinkSumSize为0，但循环条件dsinkSumDataCopyLoop == dsinkSumMaxCopyTimePerN1-1仍然成立，此时currentCopyDataSize会被赋值为0。\n\n**问题类型**: 边界条件\n**文件路径**: `attention/flash_attention_score_grad/op_kernel/arch32/flash_attention_score_grad_post.h`\n**行号**: 813\n**问题代码**:\n```unknown\nint currentCopyDataSize = (dsinkSumDataCopyLoop ==  dsinkSumMaxCopyTimePerN1-1) ? tailDsinkSumSize : 2 * ubBaseSize;\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n1. 添加对tailDsinkSumSize为0的特殊处理。2. 或者调整循环条件，当tailDsinkSumSize为0时减少循环次数。3. 使用更稳健的条件判断：int currentCopyDataSize = (dsinkSumDataCopyLoop < dsinkSumMaxCopyTimePerN1-1) ? 2 * ubBaseSize : tailDsinkSumSize;\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:03:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:10:49+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","name":"hid71829882","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/ansen-changan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":813,"end_new_line":813,"start_old_line":813,"end_old_line":813,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161493385,"discussion_id":"8a2cd8232b5b7668c511955280d8962d03f8b90f","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-28T15:07:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T15:07:49+08:00","user":{"id":"68848dafdea8931fab644b30","login":"ansen-changan","object_id":"68848daf